BT /F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 752 Tm (Repo App Summary) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 726 Tm (What It Is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 708 Tm (- A small repo-hosted control layer for temporary edit sessions and audited repo) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 696 Tm (  operations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 684 Tm (- The main service in gits/server/harvester.js issues JWTs, logs session events, and runs) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 672 Tm (  allowlisted commands in a Docker sandbox.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 624 Tm (Who It's For) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 606 Tm (- Primary persona \(inferred\): developers or repo maintainers who want a tracked edit) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 594 Tm (  session and restricted, auditable automation around a workspace.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 546 Tm (What It Does) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 528 Tm (- Issues short-lived JWT edit-session tokens via /enter and /exit endpoints.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 516 Tm (- Stores the local token in .edit_token and wires a commit-msg hook during edit mode.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 504 Tm (- Appends JSON audit entries for enter, exit, and run events to audit.log.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 492 Tm (- Optionally signs audit lines or audit digests with GPG when available.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 480 Tm (- Allowlists only lint, tests, and harvest operations on the /run endpoint.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 468 Tm (- Executes those operations in an ephemeral Docker container with no network and a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 456 Tm (  read-only workspace mount.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 408 Tm (How It Works) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 390 Tm (- Client scripts in gits/client call the harvester service on localhost:5000.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 378 Tm (- The harvester service validates JWTs, rate-limits requests, and records audit metadata.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 366 Tm (- For /run, it builds a docker run command using node:18, --network none, --read-only, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 354 Tm (  a /workspace:ro mount.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 342 Tm (- docker-compose.yml exposes port 5000, injects HARVESTER_SECRET and TOKEN_TTL, and mounts) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 330 Tm (  the repo plus audit.log.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 318 Tm (- Related auth/audit server variant: gits/server.js. Frontend UI: Not found in repo.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 306 Tm (  Persistent database: Not found in repo.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 258 Tm (How To Run) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 240 Tm (- cd gits) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 228 Tm (- Set HARVESTER_SECRET in the environment, then run docker compose up --build) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 216 Tm (- Start a session: ./client/enter-edit-mode.sh "<user>") Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 204 Tm (- Run an allowlisted op: ./client/harvest-run.sh lint | tests | harvest) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 192 Tm (- Finish the session: ./client/exit-edit-mode.sh) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 180 Tm (- Dockerfile/package manifest/install doc for this service: Not found in repo.) Tj ET
